    "reviews": "\u201cA terrific experience, imbued with personality at every turn, that can be polished off in a single session.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Finger Guns<br><br>\u201cNot only have ustwo created a world that is stunning to look at, but they\u2019ve crafted a narrative that boldly shouts that this girl can.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 The Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201cThe story and gameplay for Alba: A Wildlife Adventure is both delightful and eye-opening for anyone who decides to pick up a camera and hunt for that perfect lynx picture.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 Screen Rant<br>",
